      "mergeID": "5bb569b311ea364f0731946f",
      "mergedPostDetails": "It's not an important bug, but it's quite strange. Very often when I enter on any map in the distance I can notice a white dot, and approaching I find the icon of the microphone and notifications, and has the same animation of the one I have at the bottom left of my screen. This duplicate reacts in the same way as what I have on the screen, so if I hide the one on the screen, that disappears too",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Mic icon and notification duplicate in the map",
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "5b4a9c619668c10902911727",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "its not a duplicate lol its the ones on your hud itself\nthe icons are stored in the same scene just far away from 0.0.0 \nand using a script they bring it close to your face lol \nalot of games do this lol but in vrchat you can make a world big enough (or just get lucky) and find the icons lol",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
