  "details": "I've noticed this for a while but usually saw it from far away and thought it was just a red dot. Because it's on the UI layer you can see it through worlds. Sometimes it spawns around (0, 0, 0), but other times it's farther off.\n\nIn this image my actual mic icon is the one at the bottom left, the one anchored in the world is at the top right. When you're next to it like I was here you can look around and make more smaller mic icons appear, as if it's an endless hallway.",
